<li style="border: 1px solid #D5E0E8; border-top: 3px solid #1170AE; padding: 24px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px">
<span style="font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', 'Noto Sans KR', sans-serif; font-size: 28px; font-weight: 600; color: #1170AE">03</span>
